  # ---- 验证回环线 ----
  - elementId: loop-back
    elementType: line
    bounds: [314, 274, 364, 28]
    viewBox: [364, 28]
    points: "364,0 364,24 0,24 0,4"
    curve: sharp
    arrow: [null, arrow]
    border: {style: dash, width: 1.5, color: "$terra"}
  - elementId: loop-back-t
    elementType: text
    bounds: [386, 304, 220, 14]
    content:
      fontSize: 10
      color: "$muted"
      align: [center, top]
      wrap: false
      text: 验证不通过:回到行动,重新取数或补数
  # ---- 效果对比 ----
  - elementId: eff-box
    elementType: shape
    bounds: [56, 334, 848, 46]
    shapeName: rect
    fill: {type: solid, color: "$paleG"}
  - elementId: eff-icon
    elementType: icon
    bounds: [72, 348, 18, 18]
    iconName: "fas:clock"
    fill: {type: solid, color: "$pine"}
  - elementId: eff-body
    elementType: text
    bounds: [100, 344, 788, 26]
    content:
      fontSize: 12
      color: "$ink"
      align: [left, middle]
      wrap: false
      text: |
        <p><strong>效果对比(教学演示数据):</strong>人工做这份周报约 90 分钟 → 智能体跑一圈约 4 分钟,人只在第⑤步花 2 分钟确认。</p>
  # ---- 检查提问 ----
  - elementId: chk-box
    elementType: shape
    bounds: [56, 396, 848, 68]
    shapeName: rect
    fill: {type: solid, color: "$paleT"}
  - elementId: chk-h
    elementType: text
    bounds: [72, 406, 200, 18]
    content:
      fontSize: 13
      bold: true
      color: "$terra"
      wrap: false
      text: 检查提问
  - elementId: chk-body
    elementType: text
    bounds: [72, 428, 816, 28]
    content:
      fontSize: 12
      color: "$ink"
      lineHeight: 1.45
      text: |
        <p>哪个环节最容易被省掉?——第③④步的反馈与验证。省掉它们,报告里的错误数字会原样流到收件人手里。</p>
  # ---- 页脚 ----
  - elementId: footer-line
    elementType: shape
    bounds: [56, 502, 848, 1]
    shapeName: rect
    fill: {type: solid, color: "$hair"}
  - elementId: footer-src
    elementType: text
    bounds: [56, 510, 640, 14]
    content:
      style: "$caption"
      wrap: false
      text: 教学演示:基于智墒 / 天圻公开产品能力的示例场景,数据为示例
  - elementId: footer-page
    elementType: text
    bounds: [824, 510, 80, 14]
    content:
      style: "$caption"
      align: [right, top]
      wrap: false
      text: 19 / 35
